      "url": "https://parking.my.box/",
      "title": "This .box name is parked | my.box",
      "text": "Identity\nFind your .box name\nOnchain identity\nlives on .box\nThis name has recently been registered with my.box\nIf you're the owner, here's what you can do:\nManage your onchain profile\n\nUpdate your bio, social links, and wallet addresses. Your .box name is your universal identity across the ecosystem.\n\nEnable Web2 functionality\n\nSet up professional email or point this domain to a website. Enabling DNS requires providing WHOIS information to comply with standard registry regulations.\n\nGo to my.box\nWhy get a .box?\nUniversal Payments\n\nReplace long 0x addresses with a readable name. Receive crypto directly from any wallet anywhere.\n\nTrue Ownership\n\nYour name is an asset stored in your own wallet. No accounts, no middle-man, full control.\n\nENS & DNS Ready\n\nBuilt on audited ENS standards and anchored on Ethereum L1 for maximum security, decentralization, and ecosystem interoperability.\n\nFind your own .box name\nHow it Works\nWhy Choose .box?\nPricing\nFAQs\n\nCopyright 2026 © box\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Service",
